Let's expand the powers for $\dfrac{7^{7}}{7^3}=7^x$.

$\begin{align}
\dfrac{7^{7}}{7^3}&=\dfrac{\overbrace{\cancel 7\cdot \cancel 7\cdot \cancel 7\cdot 7\cdot 7\cdot 7\cdot 7}^\text{7 times}}{\underbrace{\cancel 7\cdot \cancel 7\cdot \cancel 7}_\text{3 times}}
\\\\\\
&=\underbrace{7\cdot 7\cdot 7\cdot 7}_{x\text{ times}}
\\\\
\end{align}$
